Fri Nov 13 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - Caio Bruno <cbrunofb@gmail.com>

- Initial package of cloudflare-speed-cli 1.0.12: Rust Cloudflare
  speed test CLI/TUI from the upstream git tag, vendored cargo crates.
- Upstream ships no completions command and no manpage; TLS stack is
  rustls+ring (no aws-lc-sys), so no cmake nor the fedora -O2/debug
  workarounds are needed.
